# 10. Validation (run with s = [1], c = [0], i.e. f = sin φ)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
test A: iac = 0, β = 5      → switch at idc ≈ 1 (up), retrap ≈ 4/(π√β) ≈ 0.57 (down)
test B: β = 1e-2            → reproduces your old RSJ map
test C: Ω = 5, small β      → step widths ≈ 2 |J_n(iac/Ω)|
test D: s = [0, 1]          → plateaus only at multiples of Ω/2Pi_r